{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GC0SoslpxX1793140266.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>電子支付巨頭Visa第四季度業績好過市場預期，但對前景看法審慎，拖累股價在延長交易時段，曾跌超過百分之2。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利逾60億美元，按年增長一成八。經調整每股盈利3.48美元，增長一成七。淨收入增長一成三，超過121億美元。預期新一年度的每股盈利增幅將低於今年全年的一成六。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T23:14:15.028040+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:10.068459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:52.093661+00:00","content_hash":"aac22e4e65b2a041b5cc63d90218803966afc0bf26394be2a7983c579558de18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T23:14:15.028040+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}